  {"id": "scene_1972.transition_in", "source_ref": "scene:scene_1972.transition_in", "speaker_profile": "memory_narrator.archive", "text": "记忆修复程序启动……你睁开眼，回到了1972年的西安老巷。", "subtitle_segments": ["记忆修复程序启动……", "你睁开眼，回到了1972年的西安老巷。"], "emotion": "neutral", "intensity": 0.35, "space": "memory_archive", "delivery": "pre_generated", "priority": "narration", "version": 1},
  {"id": "scene_1972.transition_out", "source_ref": "scene:scene_1972.transition_out", "speaker_profile": "memory_narrator.archive", "text": "老巷的光影渐渐模糊，陈守义的身影远去。时光开始流转……", "subtitle_segments": ["老巷的光影渐渐模糊，陈守义的身影远去。", "时光开始流转……"], "emotion": "sad", "intensity": 0.45, "space": "memory_archive", "delivery": "pre_generated", "priority": "narration", "version": 1},
  {"id": "npc.chen_shouyi_young.intro", "source_ref": "npc:chen_shouyi_young.fallback_dialogue", "speaker_profile": "chen_shouyi.age_25", "text": "额守着这方幕布，就像守着爷爷留下的一盏灯。你愿意听额讲讲皮影吗？", "subtitle_segments": ["额守着这方幕布，就像守着爷爷留下的一盏灯。", "你愿意听额讲讲皮影吗？"], "emotion": "warm", "intensity": 0.6, "space": "old_alley", "delivery": "pre_generated", "priority": "dialogue", "version": 1},
  {"id": "fragment_shadow_puppet.memory", "source_ref": "fragment:fragment_shadow_puppet.memory_text", "speaker_profile": "memory_narrator.archive", "text": "陈守义最拿手的是三英战吕布。他说爷爷教他的时候，他才5岁，够不到戏台，要站在板凳上。", "subtitle_segments": ["陈守义最拿手的是三英战吕布。", "他说爷爷教他的时候，他才5岁，够不到戏台，要站在板凳上。"], "emotion": "warm", "intensity": 0.5, "space": "memory_archive", "delivery": "pre_generated", "priority": "narration", "version": 1},
  {"id": "fragment_grandpa_knife.memory", "source_ref": "fragment:fragment_grandpa_knife.memory_text", "speaker_profile": "memory_narrator.archive", "text": "这把刻刀是爷爷传给陈守义的。爷爷说，皮影匠人的刻刀就像剑客的剑，从不离身。", "subtitle_segments": ["这把刻刀是爷爷传给陈守义的。", "爷爷说，皮影匠人的刻刀就像剑客的剑，从不离身。"], "emotion": "warm", "intensity": 0.45, "space": "memory_archive", "delivery": "pre_generated", "priority": "narration", "version": 1},
  {"id": "fragment_three_kings.memory", "source_ref": "fragment:fragment_three_kings.memory_text", "speaker_profile": "memory_narrator.archive", "text": "陈守义说，他这辈子最骄傲的事，就是1970年在西安城墙下给300个人演了一场三英战吕布。", "subtitle_segments": ["陈守义说，他这辈子最骄傲的事，", "就是1970年在西安城墙下给300个人演了一场三英战吕布。"], "emotion": "warm", "intensity": 0.55, "space": "memory_archive", "delivery": "pre_generated", "priority": "narration", "version": 1},
  {"id": "hypothesis_1972_legacy.resolution", "source_ref": "hypothesis:hypothesis_1972_legacy.resolution", "speaker_profile": "memory_narrator.archive", "text": "两条记忆互相印证。你可以带着这份理解作出选择。", "subtitle_segments": ["两条记忆互相印证。", "你可以带着这份理解作出选择。"], "emotion": "hopeful", "intensity": 0.5, "space": "memory_archive", "delivery": "pre_generated", "priority": "critical", "version": 1}
